 {"question" "q-32522" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "4i-6j+2k"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070857/state.json" "file_sha256" "d1c3c5666e14ee210e237c0c1918a47251637f00dd4def28595311827c8b7293" "basis" 2540 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070857/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-32522" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "i+6j+2k"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070857/state.json" "file_sha256" "d1c3c5666e14ee210e237c0c1918a47251637f00dd4def28595311827c8b7293" "basis" 2540 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070857/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129140" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{4}[3f(t)-g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t$ \ngiven that \n${\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-1,\\,-2,\\,1⟩$\nand \n${\\int }_{0}^{4}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,4,\\,-1⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "bd85708dc06aa312de092dc6485b222955dc1688ed91ada4549eda4c56dd9f12" "basis" 1850 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129140" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "From the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{4}[3f(t)-g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t=3{\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{4}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{4}[3f(t)-g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & =3{\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{4}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =3⟨-1,\\,-2,\\,1⟩-⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,4,\\,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-3,\\,-6,\\,3⟩-⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,4,\\,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,-10,\\,4⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "bd85708dc06aa312de092dc6485b222955dc1688ed91ada4549eda4c56dd9f12" "basis" 1850 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129140" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b7121365a5651064a63e6ad7ea3d7b613dcf9341122c72f075f95529beee1ea" "basis" 1850 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129140" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "bd85708dc06aa312de092dc6485b222955dc1688ed91ada4549eda4c56dd9f12" "basis" 1850 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129140" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,-10,\\,4⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "bd85708dc06aa312de092dc6485b222955dc1688ed91ada4549eda4c56dd9f12" "basis" 1850 "ver