ial/14057355/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-98157" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨2{e}^{2}+7,\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2-3,\\,21⟩"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "bd85708dc06aa312de092dc6485b222955dc1688ed91ada4549eda4c56dd9f12" "basis" 1850 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129270" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{0}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨5,\\,1,\\,20⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{4}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨1,\\,1,\\,8⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "bd85708dc06aa312de092dc6485b222955dc1688ed91ada4549eda4c56dd9f12" "basis" 1850 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129270" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{4}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{4}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{0}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{4}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨5,\\,1,\\,20⟩-⟨1,\\,1,\\,8⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,0,\\,12⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "bd85708dc06aa312de092dc6485b222955dc1688ed91ada4549eda4c56dd9f12" "basis" 1850 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129270" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b7121365a5651064a63e6ad7ea3d7b613dcf9341122c72f075f95529beee1ea" "basis" 1850 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129270" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "bd85708dc06aa312de092dc6485b222955dc1688ed91ada4549eda4c56dd9f12" "basis" 1850 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129270" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-1,\\,-8,\\,3⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "bd85708dc06aa312de092dc6485b222955dc1688ed91ada4549eda4c56dd9f12" "basis" 1850 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-129270" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-2,\\,-3,\\,15⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/re